# Frequency conversion between hertz and gigahertz

Verifies direct conversion between hertz and gigahertz in both directions. Hertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion and four-place rounding, while gigahertz converts exactly to hertz.

>>> source
forward_whole: int = 1hz
print(forward_whole->to(ghz))
forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5hz
print(forward_fractional->to(ghz))
backward_whole: int = 1ghz
print(backward_whole->to(hz))
backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5ghz
print(backward_fractional->to(hz))

<<< stdout
0.0000ghz
0.0000ghz
1000000000hz
1500000000.0hz

<<< stderr
